# Build before ship

Before committing or pushing changes in this repo, run `npm run build` (`tsc -b && vite build`) and fix any TypeScript/build errors first.

When the change is part of work that also touches **mojo-management-frontend**, run `npm run build` in **both** frontends before commit/push — do not ship one while the other is red.
